<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 1.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 1.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in Russia's North Caucasus, Volga River and Urals regions may be closed for short periods on July 1 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 80 percent, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
